<span id="S5.T2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S5.T2.2.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Options:</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">A. Placing the infant in a supine position on a firm mattress while sleeping</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">B. Keeping the infant covered and maintaining a high room temperature</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S5.T2.2.6" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S5.T2.2.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:327.8pt;">
