</span></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Prompts</h5>

<div id="S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We adopt a modified version of the prompt template from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">Zhang et al., 2025</a>)</cite>, where input will be replaced with a multiple-choice question. The prompt is shown below:</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
<figure id="LST1" class="ltx_float ltx_lstlisting">
<div id="LST1.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx1" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
