<div id="A1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Note:</span> The <span id="A1.p2.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{response}</span> and <span id="A1.p2.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">{correct_answer}</span> placeholders were dynamically filled with the actual model-generated response and ground truth answer for each evaluation instance.</p>
</div>
<div id="A1.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p3.1" class="ltx_p">In the sections below, we will provide some sample prompt-response pairs from the LLM-judge experiments.</p>
</div>
